# CODEOWNERS — CloudForge-Platform-Foundation
#
# Solo-maintainer setup: all governed paths point to the same owner.
# Purpose: force any change to governed scope to go through a PR
# (not a direct push) and be explicitly reviewed/approved, closing
# the gap found in P0-6 Negative #2 (self-modifying workflow attack),
# where the Smart Gate's own path-filter logic could be edited away
# in the same commit that violated it.
#
# NOTE (solo-maintainer limitation): GitHub does not allow a PR author
# to satisfy "require review from Code Owners" by approving their own
# PR. With a single collaborator, branch protection should NOT enable
# that rule — see docs/adr/ for the accepted mitigation instead
# (see ADR on P0-6 Negative #2 finding).

